{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 29,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Justification by Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "O foolish Galatians! Who has bewitched you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits that you should not obey the truth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that you should not obey the truth, before whose eyes Jesus Christ was clearly portrayed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits among you"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "among you as crucified? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "This only I want to learn from you: Did you receive the Spirit by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Are you so foolish? Having begun in the Spirit, are you now being made perfect by the flesh? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Have you suffered so "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or great"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "many things in vain—if indeed "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in vain?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore He who supplies the Spirit to you and works miracles among you, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does He do it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " by the works of the law, or by the hearing of faith?— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "just as Abraham "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“believed God, and it was accounted to him for righteousness.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore know that "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "only"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " those who are of faith are sons of Abraham. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the Scripture, foreseeing that God would justify the Gentiles by faith, preached the gospel to Abraham beforehand, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "saying,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“In you all the nations shall be blessed.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So then those who "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of faith are blessed with believing Abraham."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Law Brings a Curse"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as many as are of the works of the law are under the curse; for it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Cursed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "everyone who does not continue in all things which are written in the book of the law, to do them.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But that no one is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "declared righteous"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "justified by the law in the sight of God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " evident, for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the just shall live by faith.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet the law is not of faith, but "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the man who does them shall live by them.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Christ has redeemed us from the curse of the law, having become a curse for us (for it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“Cursed"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "everyone who hangs on a tree”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "), "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that the blessing of Abraham might come upon the Gentiles in Christ Jesus, that we might receive the promise of the Spirit through faith."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Changeless Promise"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, I speak in the manner of men: Though "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " only a man’s covenant, yet "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "if it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " confirmed, no one annuls or adds to it. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now to Abraham and his Seed were the promises made. He does not say, “And to seeds,” as of many, but as of one, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“And to your Seed,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " who is Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this I say, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law, which was four hundred and thirty years later, cannot annul the covenant that was confirmed before by God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits in Christ"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "in Christ, that it should make the promise of no effect. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if the inheritance "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the law, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " no longer of promise; but God gave "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Abraham by promise."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Purpose of the Law"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What purpose then "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "does"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "serve?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " It was added because of transgressions, till the Seed should come to whom the promise was made; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and it was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " appointed through angels by the hand of a mediator. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now a mediator does not "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "mediate"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " for one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "only,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " but God is one."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "Is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the law then against the promises of God? Certainly not! For if there had been a law given which could have given life, truly righteousness would have been by the law. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But the Scripture has confined all under sin, that the promise by faith in Jesus Christ might be given to those who believe. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But before faith came, we were kept under guard by the law, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. confined"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "kept for the faith which would afterward be revealed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore the law was our "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "In a household, the guardian responsible for the care and discipline of the children"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tutor "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to bring us"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to Christ, that we might be justified by faith. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But after faith has come, we are no longer under a tutor."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Sons and Heirs"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For you are all sons of God through faith in Christ Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as many of you as were baptized into Christ have put on Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There is neither Jew nor Greek, there is neither slave nor free, there is neither male nor female; for you are all one in Christ Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And if you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Christ’s, then you are Abraham’s seed, and heirs according to the promise."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}